title: Gigi_Monologue
---
Gigi: "Hang in there!" "We love you, Gigi." "Come on, it's not that bad, you'll find the right one..."
<<wait 2>>
Gigi: ...Yeah, well, screw you.
Gigi: Since when is just hoping for things to get better considered a way of living...?
Gigi: I tried! With everything I had, I really tried!
<<wait 2>>
Gigi: Why is it so easy for everyone else... but not for me?
Gigi: They have a wife, kids, a house, a career...
Gigi: And me? My last relationship was in middle school, I live in a 10m² shoebox, and I just got fired.
Gigi: This is...! This can't be happening...! I've done everything I was supposed to and...!
Gigi: And... I still failed...
<<wait 3>>
Gigi: Like I always do...
<<movePlayer 5 0 0.5>>
Gigi: This can’t be happening...
<<movePlayer 15 15 0.5>>
===

title: Gigi_Monologue_2
---
Gigi: I can’t believe I’ve fallen this low...
Gigi: Great timing for a joke, Gigi. Well done...
<<wait 3>>
Gigi: How did I even end up like this?
Gigi: All those girls at work... they seem so perfect...
Gigi: Like they’ve never failed at anything in their entire lives.
Gigi: Living their little princess lives in their perfect little worlds...
Gigi: I wish I could’ve felt satisfied. Just once...
Gigi: Just one time, that’s all I needed… just one.
Gigi: Maybe that would’ve been enough to stop me from jumping...
Gigi: Sigh... why am I even thinking about this now?
Gigi: I’m falling, it’s...
Gigi: Sniff …too late...
===

title: Gigi_Monologue_3
---
Gigi: I... I’m still... alive...?
Gigi: Where the hell am I?! The sewers?!
Gigi: ...
Gigi: No way I’m reaching that ladder... it’s way too high.
Gigi: I guess I could just let myself die here…
Gigi: ...
Gigi: ...
Gigi: No. I can’t do that to myself... If I’m gonna die, at least let it be on the streets, not rotting down here.
Gigi: Well... guess I’m on my own. Time to find a way out.
===